OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after sexual assault
OL,4,Aon train to Kilmarnock
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman
OL,7,Fwas sexually assaulted on a train from
OL,8,FGlasgow to Kilmarnock.
OL,10,FBritish Transport Police said the
OL,11,Falleged sexual assault happened at
OL,12,Fabout 20:30 on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe man, who was in his 30s, was forced
OL,15,Fto leave the train and the woman got
OL,16,Foff at Kilmarnock train station. He was
OL,17,Farrested and released under
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,20,FPolice are appealing for the victim of
OL,21,Fthe assault and for anyone who
OL,22,Fwitnessed the incident to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
